[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5341\u56db\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_wild_m",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_loop",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's about time you showed up, Hoshiguma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Apologies. We were delayed for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Any injuries?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, we were shocked by how strong that Infected was.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Special Ops Division had already committed a lot of members to reinforcing Lungmen's defense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had to take the rest of the available members with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Was your entire squad really held up by a single enemy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't believe it either until I saw her with my own eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "That person... truly was that strong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "On top of that, she seemed a bit... absent-minded?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, about these people standing next to you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, is she...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoshiguma, an elite from the Special Operations Division.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're the Rhodes Island that I've been hearing so much about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, such a young kid. Are you also with Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's their leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, Madam Ch'en...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Woah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, let's cut the small talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any ideas about what we do now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two of our special agents have located the kidnappers' location.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're tracking Reunion as we speak, and can provide us with directions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch'en, I can see why they've earned your praise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "These people take their work seriously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en... praised us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoshiguma, gather all our squads. It's time to move out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lead the way, Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood. As expected, Reunion left behind some scattered forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll be lying in ambush on our route...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not a problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, as long as we move cautiously, we'll be able to take the initiative against them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see how well you fight, Rhodes Island!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
